# Azure Beastbinder: "up to one target artifact, creature, or planeswalker an opponent controls loses all abilities until your
# next turn." Bot2's Jace, the Mind Sculptor (a planeswalker, no artifact or creature) may be targeted, while Bot2's Island (none
# of the three) is refused. Jace loses its loyalty abilities (CR 613.1f), so on Bot2's turn 4 none can be activated; it is no
# creature, so it gets no size (CR 613.4b).

